- For equipment_confirmed: need candidate_prepared shift_candidate_beta (true), candidate_equipment_linked shift_candidate_beta equipment_resource_alpha (after assign_equipment_resource), not equipment_confirmed shift_candidate_beta (true initially). Good.

- For verify_loading_profile_nominal: need candidate_staged_for_loading shift_candidate_beta (after equipment_confirmed), candidate_skill_certificate_linked shift_candidate_beta skill_certificate_alpha (after assign_skill_certificate), candidate_operator_linked shift_candidate_beta driver_operator_alpha (after assign_operator_resource), candidate_loading_container_linked shift_candidate_beta loading_container_beta (init), loading_container_leg_linked loading_container_beta transport_leg_alpha (after load_loading_container), not destination_leg_loaded transport_leg_alpha (init has origin_leg_loaded true, destination_leg_loaded false), not candidate_loading_verified shift_candidate_beta (true initially). Good.

- For establish_clearance_origin_loaded: need candidate_loading_verified shift_candidate_beta (after verify_loading_profile_nominal), candidate_compliance_certificate_linked shift_candidate_beta compliance_certificate_alpha (after assign_compliance_certificate), candidate_loading_container_linked shift_candidate_beta loading_container_beta (init), loading_container_leg_linked loading_container_beta transport_leg_alpha (after load_loading_container), origin_leg_loaded transport_leg_alpha (init), not destination_leg_loaded transport_leg_alpha (true), not candidate_clearance_established shift_candidate_beta (true initially). Good.

- For apply_operational_constraint: need candidate_prepared shift_candidate_beta (true), candidate_task_profile_linked shift_candidate_beta route_task_profile_alpha (init), operational_constraint_available operational_constraint_beta (init true), candidate_operational_constraint_linked shift_candidate_beta operational_constraint_beta (init true), not constraint_applied shift_candidate_beta (true initially). Good.

- For confirm_operator_alignment: need constraint_applied shift_candidate_beta (after apply_operational_constraint), candidate_operator_linked shift_candidate_beta driver_operator_alpha (after assign_operator_resource), not operator_alignment_confirmed shift_candidate_beta (true initially). Good.

- For verify_compliance_certificate: need operator_alignment_confirmed shift_candidate_beta (after confirm_operator_alignment), candidate_compliance_certificate_linked shift_candidate_beta compliance_certificate_alpha (after assign_compliance_certificate), not compliance_validation_complete shift_candidate_beta (true initially). Good.

- For finalize_candidate_after_compliance_validation: need compliance_validation_complete shift_candidate_beta (after verify_compliance_certificate), not candidate_finalized shift_candidate_beta (true initially). Good.

All preconditions satisfied.

